      "dot": "violet", "title": "Prediction (Step 4)",
      "items": [
        "x = x_bar_RNN + v_tilde * dt_step, with v_tilde ~ N(0, sigma_v(x)^2) at each particle's current cell",
        "A missing .sr.npz with SR enabled raises FileNotFoundError",
        "The pipeline passes a just-trained GRU in memory (skipping load_rnn) but never the SR model"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber", "title": "Window modes and extras",
      "items": [
        "Autoregressive: predicted x, y, z is fed back; teacher-forced (default): next frame read from data_dir",
